OL,3,AWhat tariffs will really cost Canadians
OL,4,Aand Americans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US and Canada have been locked in a
OL,7,Fbitter trade conflict since President
OL,8,FDonald Trump launched his tariffs
OL,9,Fpolicy on his return to the White
OL,10,FHouse.
OL,12,FThe latest escalation has seen Canadian
OL,13,FPrime Minister Mark Carney impose
OL,14,Fretaliatory import taxes on a host of
OL,15,FUS goods which came into force this
OL,16,Fweek, after Trump threatened hikes of
OL,17,Fhis own.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
