OL,3,AWhat tariffs will really cost Canadians
OL,4,Aand Americans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the dust settles in this tit-for-tat
OL,7,Ftariff row between the North American
OL,8,Fneighbours, here's what will be
OL,9,Faffected most on both sides of the
OL,10,Fborder.
OL,12,FIf Trump's threat to raise tariffs on
OL,13,FCanadian vehicles from 25% to 50% from
OL,14,F1 January 2027 becomes a reality, then
OL,15,Fthat would deal a further blow to the
OL,16,Fautomotive industry.
